cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you build on this software, findings, or ideas, please cite this repository and the exact commit used."
type: software
title: "DAV: Dependency-aware verification for coding agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Legotin
    given-names: Artem
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - AGPL-3.0-only
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/arlegotin/DAV"
url: "https://github.com/arlegotin/DAV"
abstract: >-
  An exact evidence-acquisition planner and replayable coding-agent
  verification study. Two separate pilots ended inconclusive and no-go. The
  fresh pilot supported a simpler test-only workflow within a small sample; no
  fitted or held-out advantage of dependency-aware acquisition was
  established.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - verification
  - correlated evidence
  - evidence acquisition
  - negative results
  - reproducibility
